+      "_doc": "An opener (`{{`, `{{{`, `{{!`, `{{!--`, `{{{{`, with optional `~`) that has NO `}}` to end-of-line \u2014 an unterminated construct (ADR-023 floor reconciliation). Matched BEFORE the tag rules so it flags the orphan instead of a begin/end rule consuming to a later closer. Agrees with the recovering engine lexer (a bare opener with no closer is unterminated there too). Per-line / stateless: a multi-line VALID tag's first line can false-match here in no-LSP contexts \u2014 the engine/Lab and the LSP semantic tokens are exact. Valid single-line tags always contain `}}`, so they never match.",
